{
  "id": "poem-f8efaefac806f40780a7f03c",
  "title": "如梦令·花落莺啼春暮",
  "author": "谢逸",
  "dynasty": "宋",
  "verses": [
    "花落莺啼春暮。",
    "陌上绿杨飞絮。",
    "金鸭晚香寒，人在洞房深处。",
    "无语。",
    "无语。",
    "叶上数声疏雨。"
  ],
  "enabled": true,
  "collection": "宋词选",
  "source": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry/blob/b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee/宋词/ci.song.4000.json#record-616",
